Rename the windowing API to the Flutter master names.

The editor source targets 3.47 stable, which is what AGENTS.md tells everyone
to run, what flutter.version pins, and what the distribution builds against.
Master dropped the "Regular" prefix (WindowController, Window,
WindowControllerDelegate) and re-exports ScrollCacheExtent through
material.dart, so the source does not compile there as written.

Apply this only to work on the master channel, and reverse it before
committing:

  git apply apps/flutter_scene_editor_app/tool/patches/window_names_master.patch
  git apply -R apps/flutter_scene_editor_app/tool/patches/window_names_master.patch

Delete it once the distribution pin moves to a stable that carries the rename
(3.50), where master and stable agree.

